------------------------------------------------
. Real-World Scenario

Imagine you are working as a Data Engineer / AI Data Engineer for a banking company.

The business wants to answer questions like:

How many customers do we have?
Which city has the most customers?
What is the total transaction amount?
Which customers have the highest deposits?
Which customers have no transactions?
What is the average account balance?
Which customers have active loans?
Which transactions are suspicious?
Which accounts have unusually large withdrawals?
